  "setup_notes": [
    {
      "heading": "Installation",
      "content": "pip install ovos-skill-wordnet\n\nNo API key is required. WordNet data downloads automatically on first use (about 30-60 MB for English) and stays cached locally. When no native gloss is available, the system translation plugin translates non-English definitions.\n\n---"
    }
